#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model:spk.website.resource,direct_answer:spk_website_v2.resource_lte_vs_wifi
msgid ""
"LTE and Wi-Fi are connection choices. The right choice depends on coverage "
"at the planned reader location, network ownership and the operating "
"requirements of the site. Start with those constraints before comparing "
"reader variants. Both still need power, compatible lock hardware and a "
"careful installation: the connection only decides how the reader reaches the"
" platform."
msgstr ""
"LTE und Wi-Fi sind Verbindungsoptionen. Die richtige Wahl hängt von der "
"Abdeckung an der geplanten Leserposition ab, davon, wem das Netzwerk gehört,"
" und von den Betriebsanforderungen des Standorts. Beginnen Sie mit diesen "
"Rahmenbedingungen, bevor Sie Leservarianten vergleichen. Beide benötigen "
"weiterhin Stromversorgung, kompatible Verriegelungstechnik und eine "
"sorgfältige Installation: Die Verbindung entscheidet nur darüber, wie der "
"Leser die Plattform erreicht."

#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:spk.website.resource,body:spk_website_v2.resource_lte_vs_wifi
msgid "LTE and Wi-Fi reader comparison."
msgstr "Vergleich von LTE- und Wi-Fi-Lesern."

#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:spk_website_v2.reader_comparison
msgid "LTE and Wi-Fi reader requirements"
msgstr "Anfor­de­run­gen an LTE- und Wi-Fi-Leser"

#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:spk_website_v2.page_integrators
msgid ""
"LTE and Wi-Fi readers share the same platform. The connection the site can "
"support decides which one fits; power and compatible door hardware are "
"needed either way. Every reader can also act as a Thread Border Router and "
"as a router in the Thread mesh, with the same firmware."
msgstr ""
