#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:spk.website.resource,body:spk_website_v2.post_smart_home_trends_2025_the_future_of_secure_and_connected_living
msgid ""
"With <strong>SmartphoneKey’s event log feature,</strong> users get "
"<strong>full transparency</strong> and <strong>real-time access "
"tracking,</strong> making it easier to manage entry permissions while "
"maintaining accountability."
msgstr ""

#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:spk.website.resource,body:spk_website_v2.post_smart_home_trends_2025_the_future_of_secure_and_connected_living
msgid ""
"With SmartphoneKey, property owners can provide <strong>temporary, "
"restricted, or full access</strong> to residents, guests, and service "
"providers, ensuring a secure yet flexible system for shared spaces."
msgstr ""

#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:spk.website.resource,body:spk_website_v2.post_smart_home_trends_2025_the_future_of_secure_and_connected_living
msgid ""
"With SmartphoneKey, users can <strong>unlock doors without an app, reducing "
"dependency on smartphones while ensuring security.</strong> No more lost "
"keys, forgotten passcodes, or unauthorized key copies—just seamless, secure "
"entry."
msgstr ""

#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:spk.website.resource,body:spk_website_v2.post_how_smartphonekey_enhances_security_for_your_property
msgid ""
"With SmartphoneKey, you can provide secure, keyless access that keeps your "
"property protected and gives you complete control."
msgstr ""

#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:spk.website.resource,body:spk_website_v2.post_how_smartphonekey_enhances_security_for_your_property
msgid ""
"With SmartphoneKey’s digital wallet integration, you have security at your "
"fingertips, making unauthorized access nearly impossible."
msgstr ""

#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:spk.website.resource,body:spk_website_v2.resource_lte_vs_wifi
msgid ""
"With a Wi-Fi reader, the reader joins the site's own network. The network "
"owner provides the access details, keeps the network configured as the "
"installation guide describes, and tells you before passwords or equipment "
"change."
msgstr ""
"Bei einem Wi-Fi-Leser tritt der Leser dem eigenen Netzwerk des Standorts "
"bei. Der Netz­werk­ei­gen­tü­mer stellt die Zugangs­da­ten bereit, hält das "
"Netzwerk so kon­fi­gu­riert, wie es die Instal­la­ti­ons­an­lei­tung "
"beschreibt, und informiert Sie, bevor sich Passwörter oder Geräte ändern."

#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:spk.website.team.member,bio:spk_website_v2.team_ioannis_mavridis
msgid ""
"With a career spanning over two decades, Ioannis has been at the forefront "
"of telecom technology, focusing on expanding connectivity solutions and "
"enhancing customer experiences. His expertise includes strategic planning, "
"market expansion, and implementing cutting-edge telecom solutions that meet "
"evolving customer needs."
msgstr ""

#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:spk.website.team.member,bio:spk_website_v2.team_kostiantyn_dolzhenko
msgid ""
"With a strong background in telecom management and strategic development, "
"Kostiantyn has overseen numerous initiatives aimed at expanding network "
"infrastructure and enhancing service quality. His career is marked by a "
"commitment to delivering cutting-edge telecom solutions and improving "
"digital access for consumers."
msgstr ""

#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:spk.website.team.member,bio:spk_website_v2.team_vadym_sydorenko
msgid ""
"With a vision to simplify smart access control, Vadym founded SmartphoneKey,"
" focusing on innovative solutions that make property access easy and secure "
"for everyone. He is dedicated to enhancing the quality of life through "
"technology, bringing his expertise in IoT and smart home devices to the "
"forefront of the Fourth Industrial Revolution."
msgstr ""

#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:spk.website.resource,body:spk_website_v2.resource_lte_vs_wifi
msgid ""
"With an LTE reader, the reader relies on a cellular service. Someone has to "
"provide the SIM and service, keep it active and check coverage at the "
"position where the reader will be mounted."
msgstr ""
"Bei einem LTE-Leser ist der Leser auf einen Mobil­funk­dienst angewiesen. "
"Jemand muss SIM-Karte und Dienst bereit­stel­len, den Dienst aktiv halten "
"und die Abdeckung an der Position prüfen, an der der Leser montiert wird."

#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:spk.website.resource,body:spk_website_v2.post_smart_home_trends_2025_the_future_of_secure_and_connected_living
msgid ""
"With growing concerns over data privacy, <strong>smart home users are "
"prioritizing solutions that minimize data sharing.</strong> The trend toward"
" <strong>local, non-cloud-dependent</strong> smart systems is gaining "
"traction, allowing homeowners to control access without unnecessary third-"
"party involvement."
msgstr ""

#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:spk.website.resource,body:spk_website_v2.post_the_future_of_keyless_entry_why_its_time_to_upgrade_to_smartphonekey
msgid ""
"With keyless entry on the rise, now is the perfect time to move away from "
"traditional keys and intercoms. Keyless systems like SmartphoneKey are "
"rapidly becoming the standard for homes, multi-unit buildings, and short-"
"term rentals. Upgrading now gives you access to the latest technology, "
"enhanced security, and a more convenient lifestyle."
msgstr ""

#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:spk.website.team.member,bio:spk_website_v2.team_alex_sydorenko
msgid ""
"With over 20 years of experience in software development, Alex Sydorenko is "
"the driving force behind the technological vision at SmartphoneKey. His "
"expertise spans Java development, software architecture, and leading complex"
" tech projects for companies like Luxoft and EPAM Systems. Known for his "
"problem-solving skills and innovative mindset, Alex has a track record of "
"transforming challenges into cutting-edge solutions."
msgstr ""

#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:spk_website_v2.page_visitor_access
msgid ""
"With the QR intercom workflow, a visitor scans the code at the entrance and "
"follows the site's configured contact path. Residents and site teams can "
"manage visitor access within their available permissions and services."
msgstr ""
"Im Workflow der QR-Gegen­sprech­an­lage scannt ein Besucher den Code am "
"Eingang und folgt dem kon­fi­gu­rier­ten Kontaktweg des Standorts. Bewohner "
"und Stand­ort­teams können den Besu­cher­zu­tritt im Rahmen ihrer "
"verfügbaren Berech­ti­gun­gen und Dienste verwalten."

#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:spk.website.resource,body:spk_website_v2.post_smartphonekey_official_launch
msgid ""
"With the official launch of SmartphoneKey, the future of access control is "
"here. Say goodbye to lost keys, complicated apps, and unreliable systems."
msgstr ""

#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:spk.website.resource,body:spk_website_v2.post_matter_standard_the_key_to_a_seamless_smart_home
